# seams-760-menus · §14 check (a): at 760 px wide, the jump bar's siblings
# menu must stay inside the window. The owner's earlier capture cropped the
# window, so this re-takes it narrower. (The back menu opens only on a
# right click, which this journey DSL's named `click` cannot address; the
# siblings menu shares the same anchored-below popover, `titlebar::menu`.)
size 760x900
start symbol present::glyph::RelationLabel

check page
  route symbol present::glyph::RelationLabel

click jump-seg-1
check siblings-menu
  route symbol present::glyph::RelationLabel
